                                                "sense_id": "0e02f5fc-f69b-3113-8ee0-deb21d475e62",
                                                "text": "And it aims to launch upon this task in an era of superlative need and supreme difficulty, the frightening era of ‘the gay plague,’ AIDS."
                                            }
